{
  "format": "bgsim.subsystem",
  "name": "XL330Rigid",
  "description": "Dynamixel XL330-M288-T for a robot model that runs in real time: the firmware P law with BAM's current limiter, the winding and the BAM M6 friction of XL330, with a rigid gear (the joint carries the armature), the joint angle as the encoder, the gain as an input and the friction's load torque sampled every 5 ms (no algebraic loop). Reads the globals k_motor, r_motor, i_limit and t_latency.",
