      {
        "id": "a001",
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "**Firmware (Position Control Mode).** duty = kp 4096/(2 pi)/(256 885) (goal - q), kp the Position P Gain register (an input: the robot changes it every tick); clamped to the current-limit window (kt w +- R i_limit)/V_bus [BAM] and to +-100 % PWM. The goal arrives t_latency late. q is the joint angle (the encoder).",
        "x": 0,
        "y": -170,
        "w": 950,
        "h": 110,
        "color": "blue"
      },
      {
        "id": "a002",
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "**Motor at the output, rigid gear (BAM in mjlab).** H-bridge MTF (duty) -> winding R -> GY kt (output side) -> horn, with the BAM M6 friction. The armature is the joint's (Revolute3DRigid Ja). The friction reads the torque delivered to the joint sampled every 5 ms (LoadSample), as BAM reads the previous physics step. No backlash.",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 860,
        "w": 1100,
        "h": 110,
        "color": "blue"
      }
    ]
